@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor "User / Appraiser" as User
box "Presentation Tier" #E3F2FD
participant "AutoCX React Cockpit\n(UI)" as Cockpit
participant "Web Audio\nSynthesizer" as Audio
end box

box "API & Business Logic Tier" #E8F5E9
participant "FastAPI Router\n(/api/predict)" as Router
participant "Pydantic\nValidator" as Pydantic
participant "In-Memory\nRegistry" as Registry
participant "Catalog & Feature\nEngineer" as Catalog
participant "Domain Guardrails\nEngine" as Guardrails
end box

box "Machine Learning Analytics Tier" #FFF3E0
participant "Module A: Ridge\nValuation Pipeline" as ModA
participant "Module B: Random Forest\nBattery SOH Engine" as ModB
end box

User -> Cockpit : 1. Input vehicle specs (Brand, Model, Year, KM, Fuel)
opt If Fuel == Electric
    User -> Cockpit : 2. Select EV telemetry preset (Near-New / Fleet / Degraded)
end
User -> Cockpit : 3. Click "Ignition Push-to-Start"
Cockpit -> Audio : 4. Synthesize engine acceleration audio
Audio --> Cockpit : 5. Audio playback confirmed

Cockpit -> Router : 6. HTTP POST /api/predict/car-value (JSON payload)
activate Router
Router -> Pydantic : 7. Validate schema bounds (Year 1980-2026, KM, Fuel enum)
activate Pydantic
Pydantic --> Router : 8. Validated CarPredictionRequest
deactivate Pydantic

Router -> Registry : 9. Verify loaded ML model pipelines (Zero disk I/O)
activate Registry
Registry --> Router : 10. Pre-loaded Ridge & Random Forest artifacts
deactivate Registry

Router -> Catalog : 11. Lookup Brand::Model & synthesize ratio features
activate Catalog
note over Catalog
  Computes annual_km, power_to_displacement,
  extracts model_anchor & segment_anchor (10 segments)
end note
Catalog --> Router : 12. 13-feature engineered DataFrame
deactivate Catalog

Router -> ModA : 13. Execute car valuation pipeline
activate ModA
note over ModA
  Ridge Regressor (alpha=10.0) fitted on log-target ln(1+y)
  Inverts prediction: exp(z) - 1 (Zero negative prices)
end note
ModA --> Router : 14. Raw predicted baseline resale price (INR)
deactivate ModA

Router -> Guardrails : 15. Apply empirical domain guardrails
activate Guardrails
note over Guardrails
  - High-Mileage Wear Penalty (>75,000 km)
  - Age Retention Ceiling (Maruti +5%, BMW -9%)
  - Rolling Chassis Floor (₹1.40L EV, ₹25k ICE)
end note
Guardrails --> Router : 16. Guarded vehicle resale valuation
deactivate Guardrails

alt If Fuel is Electric AND Battery Telemetry Provided
    Router -> ModB : 17. Dispatch telemetry (Cycle, Temp, Volt Spread, IR)
    activate ModB
    note over ModB
      Random Forest Regressor (Zero-Leakage Cell-Holdout)
      Evaluates 28-cell trained model on unseen cell kinematics
    end note
    ModB --> Router : 18. Predicted SOH % (65.37% fit)
    deactivate ModB
    note over Router
      Maps SOH to 5 Diagnostic Condition Tiers
      and computes 3 Informational Repair Tiers
    end note
else Fuel is ICE (Petrol / Diesel / CNG / LPG)
    note over Router
      Module B inference completely bypassed.
      Battery diagnostic state purged.
    end note
end

note over Router
  Compute strict financial conservation:
  Total Loss = Original Price - Final Resale
  Residual Retention % + Depreciation % == 100.0%
end note

Router --> Cockpit : 19. HTTP 200 OK (CarPredictionResponse JSON)
deactivate Router

activate Cockpit
note over Cockpit
  - Speedometer & Tachometer roll to values
  - F1 Rev-Limiter shift lights animate
  - Interactive 15-Year Dyno Telemetry Curve renders
  - 3D Skateboard EV chassis displays pack health
end note
Cockpit --> User : 20. Displays interactive results dashboard & audit chips
deactivate Cockpit
@enduml
